			"widgets_values":[
				"",
				"18-year-old classical maiden, facing the camera, jet-black long hair styled in a half-up half-down \"垂云髻\" structure, two pure white silk ribbons cascading from the hairstyle down to the waist, flowing in gentle wave-like motions as if moved by inner energy, loose strands of hair naturally falling over shoulders and back, delicate bangs preserved with natural texture, soft baby hairs along the hairline glowing subtly, minimalistic aesthetic without any ornamental jewelry or accessories. Surrounded by the misty atmosphere of a cold pool in the depths of Mount Zhongnan, moonlight filters through her flowing hair, creating a stunning Tyndall effect. Ethereal and serene, delicate details emphasized, high-quality rendering with 4k and 8k resolution, ultra-high definition, HDR clarity, crisp focus."
