			"widgets_values":[
				"An 18-year-old classical Chinese girl (facing the camera), with long black hair styled in a half-up, half-down \"垂云髻\" traditional hairstyle, exuding elegance and grace. Two pure white \"冰绡\" hair ribbons flow seamlessly from the bun down to her waist, rippling in a dynamic wave-like motion influenced by the inner energy of \"玉女心经,\" creating an ethereal and captivating effect. Unbound strands of hair fall naturally over her shoulders and back, showcasing aesthetic minimalism and soft, flowing beauty. Her fringes on the forehead retain a natural texture, with delicate details and a soft glow at the edges of her hairline, emphasizing youthful vibrance. Jewelry and hairpins are excluded to maintain a de-decorated purity. The scene is set against the misty cold pool of Mount Zhongnan, where the serene environment harmonizes with her presence. Moonlight gently penetrates through her flowing hair, producing a stunning Tyndall effect, blending light and shadow in intricate layers. Ultra-high definition, 4k, 8k, HDR, sharp focus, raw clarity."
